{"id":"vod_sn_38791","vodId":"38791","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"怪物王女","name_cn":"怪物王女","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2115e1ea43cc3290cb90d0e2f46651b9.jpg"},"summary":"为了救货车上的少女，善良的少年日和见日郎（大浦冬华 配音）不幸被从天而降的钢管砸中，送往医院抢救后死亡。被日朗救下的金发少女出现在了葬礼的现场，经历了一番令人瞠目结舌的神秘现象后，本已经了无生气的日郎居然重新张开了眼睛。原来，少女名叫莉莉安奴（川澄绫子 配音），个性强悍的她有着让人望而生畏的身份——怪物之王的女儿。　　莉莉安奴的血液有令人起死回生的功效，而吸食了她血液的日郎，将成为她麾下“血的战士”中的一员。作为血之战士，日郎唯一的职责就是辅佐莉莉安奴，在激烈且残酷的王位争夺战中获得最终的胜利。而随着战争的升级，莉莉安奴不为人知的过去也渐渐的浮出了水面。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tbDdcdWqpm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Qc28cY0rSP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JU5sS4Y6NX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7jnfTJVNHc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QpR2pBaWM41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QdWwAGrTVe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0LyjKFYaZd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/n61869wP3n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/eW1Qt2zLaB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GDr5YXrpws1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0ufDwHSWtW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MvPzFPvQ7i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/LWG9Xjkwbg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/z5gPMsKTBi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"